  "notes": [
    "version — версия пакета Gale; pluginVersion и assembly — метаданные приложенной декомпиляции. Игровой запуск не выполнен.",
    "rawTexts и rawPatterns: строки, которые мод хранит в объектах (названия, описания, записи Compendium, составные имена). Переводятся только при показе через Localization.Localize; сохранённые данные не меняются.",
    "Checked against Azumatt-AzuCraftyBoxes 1.8.27; AzuCraftyBoxes.dll SHA-256: 432285a08aa0d43bbd89b36330bedc19cb6ea93aed439e493d0287edaecedeb4. Existing UI literal targets remain present. Game rendering was not tested.",
    "ServerSync ErrorClient and ErrorServer source methods remain untranslated: their results are used in logs. Client errors translate only on TMP_Text.text assignment in ServerSync.VersionCheck.ShowConnectionError. ErrorServer is log-only. RPC version payloads, version comparisons, technical names and sender logs remain unchanged.",
    "The AzuCraftyBoxes Installed / Needed message translates only on TMP_Text.text assignment in AzuCraftyBoxes.ShowConnectionError.Postfix. RpcHandlers keeps the cached English ConnectionError, upstream version comparisons and logs; names and versions are opaque pattern arguments.",
    "Bulk-fuel and bulk-ammunition messages translate the remaining English items suffix at Character.Message in ShieldGeneratorOnAddFuelPatch.Prefix and Turret_UseItem_Patch.Prefix. The $msg_added game token and count remain unchanged; шт. avoids incorrect Russian declension for different counts.",
    "Update keeps the shared Pull from containers? literal English for LogDebug. The default rich-text question translates as a scoped full line at Localization.Localize; simple question-plus-choice layouts use the scoped pattern. Colored choices are display-only literals. Arbitrary custom layouts outside these known forms are not covered.",
    "Пакет текущего профиля проверен 2026-10-17 по точной установленной DLL и декомпиляции; версия пакета и BepInPlugin сверены отдельно. Игровая приёмка относится к общей квитанции выпуска."
  ],
